# CampusMind X — Client Production Environment Template
# For production deployment on Vercel, configure this under Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:

# Base URL pointing to deployed Express API Gateway (e.g. Render / Railway / Fly.io)
# If left unset, the frontend gracefully falls back to intelligent mock/offline simulation mode.
VITE_API_URL=https://campusmind-server.onrender.com/api

# Optional: Direct AI Microservice URL (FastAPI) if communicating directly instead of through API gateway
VITE_AI_ENGINE_URL=https://campusmind-ai.onrender.com
